Node1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            15_Cloud_Migration_Matrix Azure SQL Database                                           No         Single-DB target. Anything instance-level (Agent jobs, linked servers, cross-DB queries, CLR, FileStream) blocks this. Ideal for clean app-level workloads only.
